---
import { localePath, type Locale } from '../../i18n';
import ExternalBrandMark from '../common/ExternalBrandMark';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;
const p = (path: string) => localePath(locale, path);

const ceilingHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/stage2-ceiling/');
const flowHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/flow/');
const q17Pr = 'https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/pull/378';
const q17DirectW2Pr = 'https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/pull/404';
const q17DirectProbe4Pr = 'https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/pull/406';
const mechanismPr = 'https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/pull/319';
const m1aPr = 'https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/pull/358';
const seedStage2Pr = 'https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/pull/375';
---

<article class="briefing" data-ui-audit="surface" data-testid="progress-briefing">
  <section id="briefing-top" class="briefing-slide briefing-cover" data-briefing-primary aria-labelledby="briefing-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <h1 id="briefing-title">{t('OpenEVO 暑期考核汇报', 'OpenEVO Summer Research Review')}</h1>
      <p class="cover-thesis">{t('这次汇报想回答三件事：OpenEVO 做到了什么、这些结果为什么可信、遇到问题以后我们怎样把它变成更干净的下一步实验。', 'This review answers three things: what OpenEVO achieved, why the evidence is trustworthy, and how each problem was turned into a cleaner next experiment.')}</p>
      <dl class="cover-meta" aria-label={t('汇报基本信息', 'Briefing information')}>
        <div><dt>{t('汇报日期', 'Date')}</dt><dd>2026-09-08</dd></div>
        <div><dt>{t('汇报人', 'Presenter')}</dt><dd>{t('OpenEVO 项目组', 'OpenEVO project team')}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>{t('主题', 'Topic')}</dt><dd>{t('长周期自我进化、参数机制与 SEED 对照', 'Long-horizon self-improvement, mechanisms, and SEED comparison')}</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contents" class="briefing-slide tone-blue" aria-labelledby="contents-title">
    <div class="slide-inner split-slide">
      <div class="agenda-pane">
          <h2 id="contents-title">{t('今天讲四件事', 'Four things today')}</h2>
        <ol class="agenda-list">
          <li><span>01</span><strong>{t('我们现在做到哪了', 'Where we are now')}</strong></li>
          <li><span>02</span><strong>{t('这些结果说明了什么', 'What the results mean')}</strong></li>
          <li><span>03</span><strong>{t('为什么下一步这样设计实验', 'Why the next experiments look this way')}</strong></li>
          <li><span>04</span><strong>{t('接下来优先押哪条线', 'Which direction to prioritize next')}</strong></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <aside class="tldr-pane" aria-label="Too long, Don't read">
        <p class="tldr-label">Too long, Don't read</p>
        <h3>{t('一句话版本', 'One-minute version')}</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>{t('7B 和 1.7B 的长周期实验都已经跑完整。', 'Both 7B and 1.7B long-horizon runs are complete.')}</li>
          <li>{t('1.7B 训练出了 44 个参数更新候选，但只有 7 个真正进入后续模型；这让我们开始怀疑 GDR 筛得太保守。', 'The 1.7B line trained 44 update candidates, but only 7 entered later model states; that makes GDR admission itself a research question.')}</li>
          <li>{t('旧 Q17 双组对照已经冻结为诊断证据：如果在同一个实验里中途改成只用 DirectApply，原来“只差 GDR”这个比较条件就被破坏了，所以我们没有硬接着跑。', 'The old Q17 twin is frozen as diagnostic evidence: switching the same experiment to DirectApply-only would break the original one-variable comparison contract, so we did not continue it in place.')}</li>
          <li>{t('DirectApply 现在用一个全新的独立实验从同一冻结起点重新开始；第 0 轮已经证明：每卡 2 个并行采样进程与原来 1 个进程得到的 128 条结果逐字节一致，同时快了 1.63×。现在仍然没有 GDR / DirectApply 的胜负结论。', 'DirectApply now restarts as a fresh experiment from the same frozen start; Round0 proves 2 workers/GPU is byte-identical to the 1-worker baseline across all 128 attempts while running 1.63× faster. There is still no GDR-versus-DirectApply winner.')}</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
      <p class="slide-number">02 / 11</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="ceiling" class="briefing-slide tone-paper" aria-labelledby="ceiling-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <h2 id="ceiling-title">{t('WebShop 当前结果', 'Current WebShop results')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('先用和 SEED 论文相同的两列看结果：任务得分 Score，以及整道任务完全完成的成功率 Succ.。', 'Start with the same two WebShop columns used in the SEED paper: task Score and complete-task success rate (Succ.).')}</p>
      <div class="paper-table-wrap" tabindex="0" aria-label={t('SEED 论文与 OpenEVO 当前 WebShop 结果', 'SEED paper and current OpenEVO WebShop results')}>
        <table class="paper-table">
          <thead><tr><th>{t('方法', 'Method')}</th><th>WebShop Score</th><th>WebShop Succ.</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="method-group"><th colspan="3">SEED {t('（论文报告值）', '(paper-reported)')}</th></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">SEED (Qwen2.5-3B)</th><td>88.5</td><td>78.9%</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">SEED (Qwen2.5-7B)</th><td>89.7</td><td>78.1%</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">SEED (Qwen3-1.7B)</th><td>87.1</td><td>77.3%</td></tr>
            <tr class="method-group ours"><th colspan="3">OpenEVO {t('（我们的实验）', '(our experiments)')}</th></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">OpenEVO {t('（7B，长周期训练）', '(7B, long-horizon)')}</th><td>49.33</td><td>45.31%</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">OpenEVO {t('（1.7B，GDR 筛选）', '(1.7B, GDR-gated)')}</th><td>37.60</td><td>0.78%</td></tr>
            <tr class="pending-row"><th scope="row">OpenEVO {t('（1.7B，不经过 GDR）', '(1.7B, without GDR)')}</th><td>—</td><td>—</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class="table-notes">
        <p><strong>Score</strong> {t('看任务要求满足了多少；', 'measures partial requirement satisfaction;')} <strong>Succ.</strong> {t('只看任务是否完整成功。', 'counts only fully completed tasks.')}</p>
        <p>{t('SEED 是论文报告值；OpenEVO 是本地冻结的 128 题最终测试，因此这张表先用于统一阅读方式，不把它写成已经完成的同协议胜负比较。DirectApply 尚无最终分数，所以留空。', 'SEED values are paper-reported; OpenEVO uses our frozen local 128-task final panel. The table standardizes reading, not yet an apples-to-apples causal comparison. DirectApply has no final score yet, so it stays blank.')}</p>
      </div>
      <p class="slide-number">03 / 11</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="question" class="briefing-slide tone-blue" aria-labelledby="question-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <h2 id="question-title">{t('我们真正想回答的，不只是“最后多少分”', 'The real question is bigger than the final score')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('我把研究拆成三个连续问题：先确认能学到多高，再问模型内部学到了什么，最后主动改变这些东西，看行为会不会跟着变。', 'The project is three linked questions: how far can it learn, what changed inside the model, and does behavior move when we intervene on those changes?')}</p>
      <ol class="three-questions">
        <li><span>1</span><div><strong>{t('能力上限', 'Capability ceiling')}</strong><p>{t('固定预算和最终测试，OpenEVO 能持续学多久，最后到什么水平？', 'With budget and final evaluation frozen, how far can OpenEVO keep learning?')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>2</span><div><strong>{t('参数机制', 'Parameter mechanism')}</strong><p>{t('行为变了以后，模型参数里究竟形成了什么方向和结构？', 'When behavior changes, what directions and structure appear in parameter space?')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>3</span><div><strong>{t('因果控制', 'Causal control')}</strong><p>{t('把这些方向加进去、拿掉，或者改变“哪些更新能进入模型”，行为会不会按预测改变？', 'If we add or remove those directions, or change which updates enter the model, does behavior change as predicted?')}</p></div></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="bottom-claim">{t('研究主线：能力上限 → 参数机制 → 因果控制。', 'Research arc: capability ceiling → parameter mechanism → causal control.')}</p>
      <p class="slide-number">04 / 11</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="design" class="briefing-slide tone-green" aria-labelledby="design-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <h2 id="design-title">{t('我怎么保证：结果可信，而且推进得快', 'How I keep the result trustworthy without slowing the work down')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('每次提速、修复或换实现，我先问一件事：它会不会悄悄改变我要回答的科学问题？不会，才继续。', 'Every speedup or engineering change starts with one question: does it silently change the scientific question? Only changes that preserve the experiment are allowed through.')}</p>
      <div class="quality-flow">
        <div><strong>{t('同一把尺子', 'One ruler')}</strong><p>{t('同一批任务同时报告 Score 和完整成功率。', 'Use the same tasks and report Score plus exact success.')}</p></div><i>→</i>
        <div><strong>{t('一次只改一个原因', 'One causal change')}</strong><p>{t('Q17 两组只差：候选更新要不要经过 GDR。', 'Q17 differs only in whether GDR may reject an update.')}</p></div><i>→</i>
        <div><strong>{t('异常先分类', 'Diagnose before fixing')}</strong><p>{t('先分清是测量、可识别性还是因果归因出了问题。', 'First locate measurement, identifiability, or attribution failure.')}</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="speed-proof">
        <div class="speed-proof-number"><span>{t('提速资格实验', 'Speed qualification')}</span><strong>636.7 s → 389.6 s <b>1.63×</b></strong></div>
        <div><strong>{t('速度变了，科学结果没变', 'Faster execution, same experiment')}</strong><p>{t('独立 DirectApply 第 0 轮：每卡并行采样进程 1 → 2；128 条尝试记录逐字节相同，Score、5 / 128 完整成功、LoRA adapter 与训练损失全部一致。', 'Independent DirectApply-only Round0: workers/GPU 1 → 2; all 128 attempts are byte-identical, with unchanged Score, 5 / 128 exact success, LoRA adapter, and training loss.')}</p></div>
      </div>
      <p class="source-note"><a href={q17DirectW2Pr} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={q17DirectW2Pr} /> {t('DirectApply 并行资格实验 · PR #404', 'DirectApply parallelism qualification · PR #404')}</a></p>
      <p class="slide-number">05 / 11</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="mechanism" class="briefing-slide tone-gold" aria-labelledby="mechanism-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <h2 id="mechanism-title">{t('TaskVector：把“参数方向”变成一个可以被实验操纵的量', 'TaskVector: turn a parameter direction into an experimental intervention')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('这里可以更硬核一点：我们不是只看参数有没有变化，而是明确写出方向、范数和干预强度，再用同范数随机方向排除“只是参数动得多”这个解释。', 'The mechanism study explicitly defines the direction, its norm, and intervention dose, then uses norm-matched random directions to rule out a generic parameter-magnitude explanation.')}</p>
      <div class="mechanism-math">
        <div class="formula-card">
          <strong>{t('1. 从相邻且不同的参数状态定义方向', '1. Define the direction from adjacent distinct states')}</strong>
          <div class="equation">τ = ΔW<sub>R49</sub> − ΔW<sub>R27</sub> = Σ<sub>i</sub> δc<sub>i</sub>B<sub>i</sub>A<sub>i</sub></div>
          <div class="equation">‖τ‖<sub>F</sub> = √(δcᵀGδc) = 0.6082257746</div>
          <p>{t('R14 是移植目标，R27 是前一个不同状态，R49 是最终状态。参数基底有 7 个 SD-LoRA 组件，每个组件 rank=8；Gᵢⱼ=⟨BᵢAᵢ, BⱼAⱼ⟩F，所以这里算的是实际 ΔW 的 Frobenius 几何，不是简单比较 7 个系数的欧氏长度。', 'R14 is the transplant target, R27 the previous distinct state, and R49 the final state. The basis has seven rank-8 SD-LoRA components; Gᵢⱼ=⟨BᵢAᵢ,BⱼAⱼ⟩F, so the norm is exact Frobenius geometry in ΔW space rather than Euclidean distance between seven coefficients.')}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="formula-card">
          <strong>{t('2. 做有符号、有剂量、带随机对照的干预', '2. Signed, dose-controlled interventions with random controls')}</strong>
          <div class="equation">θ′(λ) = θ<sub>R14</sub> + λτ, &nbsp; λ ∈ &#123;−1, 0, 0.5, 1&#125;</div>
          <div class="equation">‖r<sub>i</sub>‖<sub>F</sub> = ‖τ‖<sub>F</sub>, &nbsp; i ∈ &#123;1,2,3&#125;</div>
          <p>{t('总共 9 组实验条件 × 每组 64 个配对任务 = 最多 576 条闭环轨迹；所有实验条件使用同一任务顺序和配对生成随机种子。', 'Nine cells × 64 paired tasks gives at most 576 closed-loop episodes; every cell uses the same task order and paired generation seeds.')}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mechanism-rules">
        <div><strong>{t('为什么要正负方向？', 'Why signed directions?')}</strong><span>{t('如果 +τ 和 −τ 产生相反趋势，比“参数动了以后碰巧变好”更像方向性证据。', 'Opposite effects for +τ and −τ are stronger directional evidence than generic movement.')}</span></div>
        <div><strong>{t('为什么要同范数随机对照？', 'Why norm-matched random controls?')}</strong><span>{t('随机方向也移动同样大的参数距离；只有 τ 明显更强，才能说“方向”本身有信息。', 'Random controls move the same Gram-norm distance, isolating direction from magnitude.')}</span></div>
        <div><strong>{t('什么时候值得继续？', 'When does this unlock the next experiment?')}</strong><span>{t('+1.0τ 必须比 3 个随机对照的中位数高至少 1.0 个 Task Score 点，而且完整成功不能比基线更差，才进入后续 1,536 条轨迹验证。', '+1.0τ must beat the median of the three random controls by ≥1.0 Task Score point without reducing exact success before the 1,536-rollout follow-up is unlocked.')}</span></div>
      </div>
      <aside class="mechanism-note"><strong>{t('这里曾经真的做错过一次', 'This construction really did fail once')}</strong><p>{t('最初选的 75% 和 100% 两个锚点其实都对应 R49，所以 τ = 0。我们没有把它写成“这个方向没有因果作用”，而是先承认实验不可识别，再改用确实不同的 R14 / R27 / R49。', 'The original 75% and 100% anchors both resolved to R49, so τ = 0. We did not call that a causal null; we marked the experiment unidentifiable and rebuilt it from distinct R14 / R27 / R49 states.')}</p></aside>
      <p class="source-note"><a href={mechanismPr} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={mechanismPr} /> PR #319</a> · <a href={m1aPr} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={m1aPr} /> PR #358</a></p>
      <p class="slide-number">06 / 11</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="twin" class="briefing-slide tone-rose" aria-labelledby="twin-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <h2 id="twin-title">{t('训练出 44 个参数更新候选，最后只有 7 个真正进入模型', '44 update candidates were trained; only 7 actually entered the model')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('这让问题从“再调一遍学习率”变成：GDR 会不会把短期看起来变差、长期却有价值的更新拒绝得太早？', 'The question shifts from another learning-rate tweak to whether GDR rejects updates that look worse immediately but help later.')}</p>
      <div class="twin-design">
        <div class="arm-a"><span>{t('如果经过 GDR', 'GDR treatment')}</span><strong>{t('候选可以被拒绝', 'Candidate may be rejected')}</strong><p>{t('候选更新训练出来以后，GDR 仍可以决定“不进入下一轮模型”。', 'After training, GDR may still keep the candidate out of the next model state.')}</p></div>
        <div class="same-core"><span>{t('公平比较必须保持', 'A fair comparison must hold')}</span><ul><li>{t('同一冻结起点', 'same frozen start')}</li><li>{t('同一任务和随机种子', 'same tasks and seeds')}</li><li>{t('同一训练配置和候选机会', 'same training config and candidate opportunities')}</li><li>{t('唯一变化：候选更新是否能被 GDR 拒绝', 'only change: whether GDR may reject the candidate update')}</li></ul></div>
        <div class="arm-b"><span>{t('如果直接应用', 'DirectApply treatment')}</span><strong>{t('合格候选直接进入下一轮', 'Qualifying candidate enters directly')}</strong><p>{t('候选满足共同训练条件以后，不再经过 GDR 否决。', 'A candidate meeting the common training conditions is not vetoed by GDR.')}</p></div>
      </div>
      <p class="bottom-claim">{t('我们原本按这个单变量合同做 twin；但后来发现“在旧双组对照里直接改成只用 DirectApply”会改变已经冻结的对照条件。这个恢复方式被拒绝，旧证据保留作诊断，DirectApply 改成新的独立实验身份。任何最终的 GDR / DirectApply 算法级结论仍至少需要 3 个 training seeds。', 'The twin was designed around this one-variable contract. Later, an in-place switch to DirectApply-only was rejected because it would mutate the frozen comparison conditions. The old evidence stays diagnostic, and DirectApply now uses a fresh experiment identity. Any final algorithm-level GDR-versus-DirectApply claim still requires at least three training seeds.')}</p>
      <p class="source-note"><a href={q17Pr} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={q17Pr} /> {t('旧 Q17 双组对照 · PR #378', 'old Q17 twin · PR #378')}</a> · <a href={q17DirectW2Pr} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={q17DirectW2Pr} /> {t('新 DirectApply 实验 · PR #404', 'fresh DirectApply experiment · PR #404')}</a></p>
      <p class="slide-number">07 / 11</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="determinism" class="briefing-slide tone-green" aria-labelledby="determinism-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <h2 id="determinism-title">{t('发现旧实验不能再“硬接”以后，我们重新开了一条 DirectApply 实验', 'When the old twin could no longer be continued cleanly, we restarted DirectApply as a fresh experiment')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('这里的选择不是“为了严谨而重跑一遍”。如果在旧双组对照里中途改变对照条件，后面的结果就无法回答原来的因果问题。我们保留旧证据，但不改写旧实验轮次；新的 DirectApply 从同一个冻结起点重新开始。', 'This is not a rerun for neatness. Changing treatment inside the frozen twin would make later results answer a different causal question. We preserve the old evidence without rewriting old rounds, and restart DirectApply from the same frozen start under a new experiment identity.')}</p>
      <div class="before-after">
        <div class="before"><span>{t('旧双组对照 · 保留作诊断', 'Old twin · diagnostic')}</span><strong>{t('不能把后续路线就地改成只用 DirectApply', 'Do not mutate the treatment in place')}</strong><p>{t('GDR 线曾推进到第 13 轮，DirectApply 第 1 轮留下 84 / 128 个有效位置；但继续时改变已经冻结的对照条件，会破坏原来的单变量归因，所以这些证据保留，不再硬拼成新的公平对照。', 'The GDR line reached Round13 and DirectApply Round1 left 84 / 128 valid positions, but changing the frozen comparison conditions during continuation would break the original one-variable attribution. Those receipts remain diagnostic rather than being stitched into a new fair comparison.')}</p></div>
        <div class="after"><span>{t('新 DirectApply · 独立实验', 'Fresh DirectApply · separate experiment')}</span><strong>{t('同一冻结起点，新的实验身份', 'Same frozen start, new experiment identity')}</strong><p>{t('旧实验轮次不复用。第 0 轮的 W1 / W2 资格实验已经证明：128 条尝试记录逐字节一致，Score、5 / 128 完整成功、LoRA adapter 和训练损失全部一致。', 'Old experiment rounds are not reused. Round0 W1/W2 qualification shows byte-identical 128 attempts with unchanged Score, 5 / 128 exact success, LoRA adapter, and training loss.')}</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="current-twin-status">
        <div><span>{t('已经证明', 'Proven')}</span><strong>636.7 s → 389.6 s · 1.63×</strong><p>{t('每卡并行采样进程 1 → 2，在不改变第 0 轮科学结果的前提下提速。', 'Workers/GPU 1 → 2 speeds up Round0 without changing the scientific result.')}</p></div>
        <div><span>{t('下一项提速仍在资格中', 'Next speedup still qualifying')}</span><strong>{t('候选评估并行化', 'parallel candidate evaluation')}</strong><p>{t('第 4 轮的影子回放已经逐条复现前 12 / 16 个候选评估结果；完整资格尚未结束，因此还没有切换正式实验控制器。', 'A Round4 shadow replay has exactly reproduced the first 12 / 16 candidate-evaluation rows. Qualification is not complete, so the formal experiment controller has not switched.')}</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="plain-language-result"><strong>{t('现在能下的结论：', 'What we can say now:')}</strong><p>{t('我们把“不能在旧实验里中途换问题”变成了新的实验身份，并证明 DirectApply 的采样可以在结果不变的前提下提速；但仍然没有 GDR / DirectApply 的最终胜负结论。', 'We turned an invalid in-place change to the comparison question into a fresh experiment identity and proved DirectApply rollout can be faster without changing Round0 results. There is still no final GDR-versus-DirectApply winner.')}</p></div>
      <p class="source-note"><a href={q17Pr} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={q17Pr} /> {t('旧双组对照 · #378', 'old twin · #378')}</a> · <a href={q17DirectW2Pr} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={q17DirectW2Pr} /> {t('DirectApply W2 · #404', 'DirectApply W2 · #404')}</a> · <a href={q17DirectProbe4Pr} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={q17DirectProbe4Pr} /> {t('候选评估并行资格 · #406', 'candidate-evaluation parallelism qualification · #406')}</a></p>
      <p class="slide-number">08 / 11</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="seed" class="briefing-slide tone-blue" aria-labelledby="seed-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <h2 id="seed-title">{t('SEED 对照线：把“起点、教师、后续训练”拆开看', 'SEED control: separate start state, teacher, and later training')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('我们不是去追论文里的 89.7 这个单点数字，而是把 SEED 的训练链拆开，问清每一层到底贡献了什么。', 'The goal is not to chase the paper’s 89.7 as a single target; it is to decompose the SEED training chain and identify what each stage contributes.')}</p>
      <figure class="pipeline" aria-labelledby="seed-pipeline-caption">
        <div class="pipeline-row">
          <div><span>01</span><strong>{t('同一个 WebShop 环境', 'Matched WebShop environment')}</strong></div><i>→</i>
          <div><span>02</span><strong>Stage1 · 1,440</strong></div><i>→</i>
          <div><span>03</span><strong>MiniMax {t('事后分析', 'hindsight')} · 1,440 / 1,440</strong></div><i>→</i>
          <div><span>04</span><strong>SFT · 1,296 / 144</strong></div><i>→</i>
          <div><span>05</span><strong>{t('Stage2 · 单独批准后启动', 'Stage2 · separately activated')}</strong></div>
        </div>
        <figcaption id="seed-pipeline-caption">{t('当前使用 MiniMax-M3 作为教师模型，因此这是独立教师条件，不等同于论文原始 GLM-5.2 设置。离线 SFT 准备已经允许进行；Stage2 还没有获准启动。', 'MiniMax-M3 is the current teacher condition, so this is not paper-exact GLM-5.2. Offline SFT preparation is authorized; Stage2 has not yet been activated.')}</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="seed-questions">
        <div><strong>{t('起点贡献多少？', 'How much comes from initialization?')}</strong><p>{t('同一批 Stage1 轨迹能否改变后续上限？', 'Does the same Stage1 experience change the later ceiling?')}</p></div>
        <div><strong>{t('教师贡献多少？', 'How much comes from the teacher?')}</strong><p>{t('事后分析带来的知识，究竟有多少被 SFT 吸收？', 'How much hindsight knowledge is actually absorbed by SFT?')}</p></div>
        <div><strong>{t('第二阶段训练贡献多少？', 'How much comes from Stage2?')}</strong><p>{t('匹配训练条件后，再和 OpenEVO 做最终比较。', 'Only after conditions are matched do we make the final OpenEVO comparison.')}</p></div>
      </div>
      <p class="source-note"><a href={seedStage2Pr} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={seedStage2Pr} /> SEED Stage2 · PR #375</a></p>
      <p class="slide-number">09 / 11</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="turning-points" class="briefing-slide tone-gold" aria-labelledby="turning-points-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <h2 id="turning-points-title">{t('遇到问题，我们先判断“哪一层科学有效性坏了”', 'When something breaks, identify which scientific validity layer broke')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('真正值得汇报的不是“修了多少 bug”，而是异常怎样改变了下一步实验。', 'The useful story is not how many bugs were fixed, but how each anomaly changed the next experiment.')}</p>
      <div class="diagnosis-table" role="table" aria-label={t('问题、判断和下一步实验', 'Problem, diagnosis, and next experiment')}>
        <div class="diagnosis-head" role="row"><strong>{t('看到什么', 'Observation')}</strong><strong>{t('我的判断', 'Diagnosis')}</strong><strong>{t('下一步怎么改', 'Next experiment')}</strong></div>
        <div role="row"><b>Score ↑，{t('完整成功不变', 'exact flat')}</b><span>{t('一个总分混了两种现象', 'one scalar mixes two phenomena')}</span><p>{t('同一批 128 题拆成“部分进展 / 真正完成”两个指标。', 'split partial progress from full completion on the same 128 tasks.')}</p></div>
        <div role="row"><b>44 {t('个候选，只进 7 个', 'candidates, only 7 admitted')}</b><span>{t('瓶颈可能是更新准入', 'admission may be the bottleneck')}</span><p>{t('把 GDR / DirectApply 做成只改一个变量的对照。', 'isolate GDR versus DirectApply as one treatment variable.')}</p></div>
        <div role="row"><b>TaskVector = 0</b><span>{t('不可识别，不是因果零效应', 'unidentifiable, not a causal null')}</span><p>{t('回到状态谱系，重建 R14 / R27 / R49。', 'rebuild from distinct R14 / R27 / R49 states.')}</p></div>
        <div role="row"><b>{t('GDR 生效前两组已不同', 'arms differ before GDR acts')}</b><span>{t('后续差异不能归因给 GDR', 'later differences are not attributable')}</span><p>{t('停止旧双组对照，修复重复性，再建立干净的第 0 轮。', 'stop the old twin, restore reproducibility, rebuild clean Round0.')}</p></div>
        <div role="row"><b>{t('想在旧双组对照里改成只用 DirectApply', 'switch the old twin to DirectApply-only')}</b><span>{t('这会改变已经冻结的科学问题', 'this mutates the frozen scientific question')}</span><p>{t('拒绝就地改变对照条件；旧证据只作诊断，另开新的 DirectApply 实验身份。', 'reject the in-place comparison-condition change; keep old evidence diagnostic and open a fresh DirectApply experiment identity.')}</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-line"><strong>{t('思路', 'Thinking')}</strong><span>{t('先定位失效层，再改问题', 'locate the broken validity layer first')}</span><strong>{t('质量', 'Quality')}</strong><span>{t('不把构造失败包装成科研结论', 'never rebrand invalid construction as a result')}</span><strong>{t('速度', 'Speed')}</strong><span>{t('当天把不可归因的 Q17 从旧双组对照拆成新的实验身份，并验证 1.63× 提速不改结果', 'same-day separation of the invalid twin into a fresh experiment identity plus a 1.63× semantics-preserving speed qualification')}</span></div>
      <p class="slide-number">10 / 11</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="next" class="briefing-slide briefing-final" aria-labelledby="next-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <h2 id="next-title">{t('最后想请老师和学长帮我选一个优先级', 'One priority choice for advisor discussion')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('旧 Q17 双组对照已经冻结，新的 DirectApply 独立实验还在推进，也还没有 GDR / DirectApply 的最终胜负。这不影响更大的路线选择：下一阶段先把机制证据做深，还是先把 SEED 匹配对照做齐？', 'The old Q17 twin is frozen, the fresh DirectApply experiment is still progressing, and there is no final GDR-versus-DirectApply winner. The larger sequencing choice remains: deepen mechanism evidence first, or complete the matched SEED comparison first?')}</p>
      <div class="choice-grid">
        <div class="choice north">
          <span>{t('向北', 'NORTH')}</span>
          <h3>{t('先做参数因果实验', 'Mechanism first')}</h3>
          <p>{t('继续 TaskVector 移植、参数主题删除和前瞻三组验证。', 'Continue TaskVector transplant, theme knockout, and the prospective three-arm trial.')}</p>
          <dl><div><dt>{t('主要回答', 'Answers')}</dt><dd>{t('OpenEVO 为什么会变强？模型内部到底学到了什么？', 'Why does OpenEVO improve, and what was learned internally?')}</dd></div><div><dt>{t('更适合', 'Choose this if')}</dt><dd>{t('优先追求机制解释、因果证据和科研亮点。', 'mechanistic explanation and causal evidence are the priority.')}</dd></div></dl>
        </div>
        <div class="choice south">
          <span>{t('向南', 'SOUTH')}</span>
          <h3>{t('先做 SEED 匹配对照', 'Matched SEED comparison first')}</h3>
          <p>{t('把 SFT 模型身份确认后启动匹配条件的第二阶段训练，再做最终测试。', 'Seal the SFT model identity, activate matched Stage2, then run final evaluation.')}</p>
          <dl><div><dt>{t('主要回答', 'Answers')}</dt><dd>{t('在尽量相同的训练条件下，OpenEVO 和 SEED 到底差多少？', 'Under matched training conditions, how far apart are OpenEVO and SEED?')}</dd></div><div><dt>{t('更适合', 'Choose this if')}</dt><dd>{t('优先需要一个更直观、容易对外比较的结果。', 'a direct, externally legible benchmark comparison is the priority.')}</dd></div></dl>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="decision-note"><strong>{t('希望老师判断的不是“做不做”，而是：', 'The question is not whether to do both, but:')}</strong><p>{t('先把论文故事做深（向北），还是先把对照结果做齐（向南）？', 'deepen the scientific mechanism story first (north), or complete the matched comparison first (south)?')}</p></div>
      <p class="final-source"><a href={flowHref}>{t('实验流程理解图', 'Experiment flow')}</a> · <a href={ceilingHref}>{t('能力上限证据', 'Ceiling evidence')}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</article>

